{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/753693-why-can-ronin-and-bone-gnawers-not-opt-out-of-acknowledging-pure-breed","id":753693,"title":"Why can Ronin and Bone gnawers not Opt out of acknowledging pure breed.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-04T04:55:08-08:00","id":753693,"title":"Why can Ronin and Bone gnawers not Opt out of acknowledging pure breed.","content":"is their a reason why a Ronin or bone gnawer who sneers at the notion of pure breed is still affected by it mechanicaly?<br /> <br /> heard some players who BITCHED about this issue.. As it says their &quot;BAD ASS&quot; Can never fully shake the influence of this fascist practice<br /> <br /> thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T05:14:49-08:00","id":753729,"title":"","content":"It affects them at an instinctual/spiritual level","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T05:33:53-08:00","id":753786,"title":"","content":"I would say 'subconsciously' but the idea is the same.<br /> <br /> There is a way to opt out, though. The stargazers have the &quot;resist temptation&quot; gift that clears their mind so some subconscious processes, including iirc their response to pure breed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T06:35:03-08:00","id":753857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/753693-why-can-ronin-and-bone-gnawers-not-opt-out-of-acknowledging-pure-breed#post753693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is their a reason why a Ronin or bone gnawer who sneers at the notion of pure breed is still affected by it mechanicaly?<br /> <br /> heard some players who BITCHED about this issue.. As it says their &quot;BAD ASS&quot; Can never fully shake the influence of this fascist practice<br /> <br /> thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can complain all you want about Brad Pitt being an overhyped sex symbol. But you'd probably do anything he says like everyone else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T07:00:41-08:00","id":753922,"title":"","content":"In the end, you can't even pathom if it is natural Charisma/Manipulation/Appearance or Pure Breed or the appropriate ability that scored the success against you and actually made you behave in a certain way for the whole dice pool is rolled as one. So, basically Pure Breed is mechanically a bonus on these three attributes and you can't defend against the player using his bonus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T07:22:33-08:00","id":753959,"title":"","content":"The others already said it.<br /> Have you read fairy tales about True Kings, the ones that just need to shake off their rags and proclaim themselves rightful heir and everyone acknowledges them? <i>That's</i> what Pure Breed feels like. And all the Children of Gaia and Bone Gnawers and Glass Walkers will gripe on how they'll never bow down to one of those stuffy and antiquated Silver Fang guys - right up until the next one walks into the room and they notice that, hey, <i>this one</i> seems like the real deal.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T14:57:23-08:00","id":754990,"title":"","content":"Just adding my voice to the chorus: Pure Breed is not merely a social thing, nor even just biological -- it's metaphysical as well. You can't simply &quot;ignore&quot; it anymore than you could ignore a big beefy man who can bench 400lbs+ when he punches you square in the face. (Of course, in that analogy, the Pure Breed garou would have that at 4 or 5 dots, but you still get the picture...)<br /> <br /> It's not like simply ignoring that status of your boss/teacher and telling them off -- Pure Breed is a metaphysical quality that affects garou regardless of how they perceive the Pure Bred garou in question; this is why -- even if they still will try to corrupt/kill you -- the Dancers give grudging acknowledgement to high-Bred wolves... said werewolves simply have &quot;it&quot;, and that's all there is to it....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have been around here for waaaayyyy too fucking long...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1433-just-john-forever","name":"Just John, Forever...","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-04T17:01:53-08:00","id":755262,"title":"","content":"Keep in mind that the Bone Gnawers and Ronin resent Purebreed <i>because</i> they can't really do anything about it (outside of a few Gifts here and there).<br /> <br /> If they could just ignore it, they wouldn't really care about it enough to gripe. It would just be something to laugh at as the high bred act all high and mighty with nothing to back it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}